### B. Duty assignment management

Create an intuitive interface for assigning responsibilities.

The Head should be able to:

1. Select a staff member.
2. Select an existing responsibility or create a new one.
3. Select one or multiple days.
4. Specify working hours, if applicable.
5. Assign primary or secondary responsibility.
6. Add relevant instructions.
